WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:01,110
and

2
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:03,000
Only great men die

3
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:04,840
Only then can we find the exit

4
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:08,740
What Brother Lin said makes sense.

5
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:10,100
We killed all the great men last time

6
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:11,020
The school just opened

7
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:13,340
I guess it's about the same here. Kill all the great men.

8
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:14,260
The exit is right out

9
00:00:14,970 --> 00:00:15,890
This is best

10
00:00:16,370 --> 00:00:17,970
But where should we check?

11
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:25,120
It's been so long since a great man took action

12
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,800
Can't find any clues?

13
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:29,720
I know who the great man is

14
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:32,100
you know who

15
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:36,700
Did I find a clue? Who is it? Brother Lin, you said we should get him?

16
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:44,630
The man who killed Liu Yunwei last time
